			description: [
				"锅炉产生的蒸汽将自动输出到已连接的管道中。"
				""
				"&6Bronze&r fluid pipes are good enough for early game needs.  A tiny or small pipe will complete the quest."
				""
				"当你能使用&6Lead&r时，&6Potin&r会成为一段时间内最好的管道材料。"
			]
